{
  "id": "050",
  "title": "The Island She Returned To",
  "subtitle": "\"My wife disappeared from a small island in Maine eleven months ago. I have been returning to the island every weekend since. Last Saturday she walked past the harbor café. She was not my wife.\"",
  "penName": "Hugh Lark",
  "genre": "mysteryThriller",
  "hook": "My wife Mara disappeared from Folger Island, Maine, on September eleventh, eleven months ago. Her rental car was found at the harbor. Her phone was found at the harbor. She was not found. The coroner said she had walked into the water. Her father said she had run. I kept returning. Every weekend for eleven months I went back. On a Saturday in August I saw her walk past the harbor café window. I followed. It was not her. It was her. It was both at once.",
